  "description": "Big wheel feels. The Race Lite Pro 24 is smooth, stable and fast on the track. Built on our heat-treated aluminum Race Lite frame, upsized for 24\" wheels with a 21.75\" top tube, You also get 24-sized chromoly forks and bars, along with the same high-performance spec as its 20\" family members: 2-piece 175mm alloy cranks with a sealed BB86 bottom bracket and 24\" alloy wheels rolling on sealed bearings. For the cruiser crew, the Pro Lite 24 is ready-to-go.\n6061-T6 heat-treated aluminum frame with integrated head tube. Internal cable routing, 3D dropouts w/integrated chain tensioners. 21.75\" top tube length.\nFull chromoly 1 1/8\" Threadless Steerer w/ Tapered Legs\n2-pc 175mm Forged Alloy w/ 24mm Hollow Spindle. 40T chainring.\n24\" Alloy 36h, double wall rims\n36h Alloy sealed bearing hubs with w/disc 16T cassette rear\nKenda \"Konversion\" tires. 24 x 1.95 front, 24 X 1.75\" rear.",
